Package: TimeVaryingVE
Title: Debiased estimation of time-varying vaccine effectiveness using vaccine-irrelevant infections
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ethan", "Ashby", , "ecadeashby@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package contains R functions for implementing time-varying vaccine effectiveness estimation that accounts for vaccine-irrelevant infections to avoid selection and confounding bias.
